    "title": "Free book expo in The Villages on Jan. 25 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Susan ,\n10 hours ago The Writers League of The Villages and the Villages Recreation Department are hosting the 2026 Book Expo from 10 a.m. to 3 p.m. Jan. 25 at the Eisenhower Recreation Center at 3569 Buena Vista Boulevard, The Villages. Admission is free. The expo will showcase “100’s of talented and award-winning authors” including Dave McKeon, writer of […]\nTo access this entire article, you must Become an Ocala Gazette Member or Subscribe to Ocala Gazette .\nAlready a member? Click here to log in .\nThe post Free book expo in The Villages on Jan. 25 appeared first on Ocala Gazette .\n2",
